UR5e and Robotiq 2F-85 MuJoCo models

Source: https://github.com/google-deepmind/mujoco_menagerie
Revision: da76818e269b82289eba39808e2fb91d679d6994

The UR5e model and meshes are distributed under the BSD 3-Clause license.
See models/universal_robots_ur5e/LICENSE.

The Robotiq 2F-85 model and meshes are distributed under the BSD 2-Clause
license. See models/robotiq_2f85/LICENSE.

The combined UR5e/Robotiq model attaches the Robotiq model to the UR5e's
published tool attachment site. It is adapted from the SpacemiT SDK's
perceptive_grasp simulation model; upstream geometry, inertial properties,
joint definitions and actuator parameters are retained. The gripper uses
its original linkage constraints; no grasp attachment or object weld is added.

scene.xml, mapping.yaml and the asset manifest are provided by SpacemiT
under Apache-2.0. Meshes are downloaded separately and checked against
the SHA-256 digests in assets.json.
